        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joss Whedon, Norman Mailer, Malcolm Reynolds, Nathan Fillion\n- Projects: Firefly, Serenity\n- Companies: Mutant Enemy Productions\n- Concepts: Firefly media franchise, space Western\n- Roles: screenwriter, director, producer, comic book writer, composer, novelist, journalist, essayist, playwright, film-maker, actor, political activist\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Mailer was born on January 31, 1923, and he was an American novelist, journalist, essayist, playwright, film-maker, actor, and political activist.\n- Joss Whedon was born on June 23, 1964, and he is an American screenwriter, director, producer, comic book writer, and composer.\n- Nathan Fillion played Malcolm Reynolds in the 2002 TV series Firefly.\n- The Firefly media franchise is an American space Western franchise created by Joss Whedon and produced by Mutant Enemy Productions.\n- Nathan Fillion played Malcolm Reynolds in the 2005 film Serenity.\n- Norman Mailer died on November 10, 2007.",
